        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "功能说明"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "- 在设置页面选择需要保留名称的项目。\n- 安装或更新插件时可刷新识别列表。\n- 可通过命令行查看状态、恢复记录名称、捕获名称或刷新列表。\n- PreferenceLoader 仅用于提供可选的设置入口；命令行工具独立提供。"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "命令"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "preference-label-keeper status\npreference-label-keeper restore\npreference-label-keeper capture\npreference-label-keeper refresh\n\n**注意：** 若名称意外被覆盖，请先检查状态；不要在名称已被意外覆盖时执行 `capture`，以免把错误名称写入记录。"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionButtonView",
          "text": "查看 GitHub 仓库",
          "action": "https://github.com/SHGnix/repo",
          "openExternal": 1
        }
